'''Derpy''' is a mayoral candidate that can be elected during the [[Mayor Election]] event and one of the five special candidates. His perks focus around causing chaos.

== Mayoral Perks ==
{{MayorPerks|Derpy|Since Derpy is a special candidate, he always runs with {{Light Purple|4 perks}}. Two of Derpy's perks increase player rewards, while the other two will make the game harder in some areas.}}{{Affected Minions List|mayor|all|preamble_text=n}}

