== Bugs ==
* {{Pink|DOUBLE MOBS HP!!!}} does not affect the [[Magma Boss]] (but still affects [[Magma Glare|Magma Glares]] and [[Unstable Magma|Unstable Magmas]]).
* For the first part of '''Derpy''''s mayor term, {{Pink|TURBO MINIONS!!!}} reduces the time used in offline calculations of [[Minions]] by {{Green|50%}}.
** The double output is applied as expected to the shortened offline time.
** This affects the duration of limited duration [[Minion Fuel]]s, making the fuel take longer to expire in real time. However the total in-game time where the fuel is active remains the same.
*** E.g. an {{Item|Inferno Minion Fuel}}, which lasts 24 hours, will take 48 real life hours to expire, but it will still make 24 hours worth of doubled drops.
** This can happen with any minions. It is not limited to {{Item|Inferno Minion}} with {{Item|Inferno Minion Fuel}}.
** The timers of [[Minion Upgrades#Cooldown_upgrades|cooldown upgrades]], {{Item|Beacon}}s{{ConfirmationNeeded}}, and {{Item|Capsaicin Eyedrops}} are not affected.
** This stops happening after 1 day, 8 hours, and 45 minutes of '''Derpy''''s mayor term.

== Trivia ==
* '''Derpy''' used to have a different skin.
* '''Derpy''' was supposed to be up for reelection in Year 128 but was replaced by {{NPCSprite|Dante}}.
** '''Derpy''' may be the opposite of {{NPCSprite|Dante}}, as '''Derpy''' wants chaos, but {{NPCSprite|Dante}} wants order.
* '''Derpy''' was supposed to be up for reelection in Year 464 but was replaced by {{NPCSprite|Aura}}.
** One of Aura's ministers picked the {{Pink|TURBO MINIONS!!!}} perk this year. However, this was bugged to not apply to offline calculations.
* The {{Pink|MOAR SKILLZ!!!}} perk affects Catacombs and Gabagool Pet experience.
* The {{Pink|QUAD TAXES!!!}} perk does not affect the time and listing fees of the [[Auction House]], only the tax for items sold over 1 million coins.
* The {{Pink|QUAD TAXES!!!}} perk replaced an old perk called {{Pink|AH CLOSED!!!}} which as described, closed the Auction House instead.

